     "indent": 0,
     "text": "Use 3.1 mm."
    },
    {
     "kind": "paragraph",
     "marker": null,
     "indent": 1,
     "text": "Due to limitation in the height at the reinforcement zone, no practical fillet weld size will supply enough reinforcement area; therefore, further reinforcement is required. Try a 160 mm O.D. reinforcing ring (measured along the run). Assume the ring to be cut from a piece of DN 200 (NPS 8) Schedule 40 API 5L Grade A seamless pipe and welded to the connection with minimum size fillet welds."
    },
    {
     "kind": "paragraph",
     "marker": null,
     "indent": 1,
