     "text": "An NPS 8 run (header) in an oil piping system has an NPS 4 branch at right angles (see Figure H311-1). Both pipes are Schedule 40 API 5L Grade A seamless. The design conditions are 300 psig at 400°F. The fillet welds at the crotch are minimum size in accordance with para. 328.5.4. A corrosion allowance of 0.10 in. is specified. Is additional reinforcement necessary?"
